 "notes": [
  "Total 60 as published (section headers 10/13/7/5/11/14).",
  "Posted 'Death Star (SE)' dested the Dark Death Star system (A New Hope); the Special Edition Death Star is a Light card, so it cannot be meant on this Dark list.",
  "Posted 'DVLOTS' dested Darth Vader, Dark Lord Of The Sith; 'Devestator' Devastator; 'Dreadnaught' Dreadnaught-Class Heavy Cruiser; 'U-3PO' U-3PO (Yoo-Threepio); 'EForest Clearing' Endor: Forest Clearing.",
  "Come Here You Big Coward, Secret Plans, Battle Order and Resistance are the older Effects (no Defensive Shields in August 1999).",
  "The strategy lists starting-Effect options by matchup (Battle Order, Security Precautions, Broken Concentration, There Is No Try); no single starting card is named, so starting is left empty.",
  "Revised version of the author's 'Imperial Black & Blue' (DeckTech 34): no docking bays, an extra Masterful Move, no Sense & Alter, Broken Concentration and Resistance added."
 ],
